# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SECRETS AND CREDENTIALS — nothing here may ever reach the remote

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Environment files. `.env` and `.env.*` match at ANY depth, so server/.env
# and client/.env are both covered. The negation must stay last of the three,
# or the example template gets swallowed by `.env.*`.
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example
!*.env.example

# Private keys and certificates
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
*.asc
*.gpg
id_rsa
id_rsa.*
id_ed25519
id_ed25519.*
*.ppk

# Tool credential files that carry auth tokens
.npmrc
.yarnrc
.netrc
.pgpass
.my.cnf
my.cnf
.aws/
.ssh/
gha-creds-*.json

# Generic credential dumps
credentials.json
secrets.json
service-account*.json
*credentials*.yml
*credentials*.yaml

# Database dumps and backups — may contain real employee/salary rows.
# NOTE: plain *.sql is deliberately NOT ignored; Prisma migration files are
# .sql and must be committed.
*.dump
*.sql.gz
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
backup/
backups/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Claude Code workspace — local to Dhanush's machine, never shared.
# Agent config, the SessionStart hook, project memory and the session log are
# personal workflow tooling; they must not reach the remote or affect anyone
# else working on this repo.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
docs/SESSION_LOG.md

# Wireframe source and its extraction — local reference only
docs/WIREFRAME_SPEC.md
*.excalidraw

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Dependencies
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.js
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
venv/
.venv/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Build output and caches
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
dist/
build/
.vite/
.cache/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Runtime / generated
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# User-uploaded files: avatars, company logos, sick-leave certificates.
# Real people's documents — never commit these.
uploads/
server/src/generated/
.prisma/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Editor / OS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Local test credentials. Contains working passwords for the seeded accounts;
# must never reach the shared remote.
test_work.txt
